WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.003
Grades 3–5. Abena, grade 4, and her teacher Ms. Al-Sayed. Read-aloud on request, a Homework Helper that gives hints, not answers, and rubric grading.

2
00:00:03.003 --> 00:00:07.808
Grades 3 to 5: Read-aloud on request, and a helper that gives hints and sentence starters, not answers.

3
00:00:07.808 --> 00:00:11.765
Abena · grade 4: Abena, grade 4, plans an opinion piece. Every instruction can be read aloud.

4
00:00:11.765 --> 00:00:17.749
Abena · grade 4: Her Homework Helper is simulated in the demo, and shows what Hall Monitor would decide for each message.

5
00:00:17.749 --> 00:00:22.694
Abena · grade 4: Asking it to write the piece is redirected: the graded work stays hers.

6
00:00:22.694 --> 00:00:29.330
Abena · grade 4: Personal details are held back: neither sent to the AI nor kept.

7
00:00:29.330 --> 00:00:41.149
Ms. Al-Sayed · grade 4 teacher: Ms. Al-Sayed scores Hana's theme essay on the activity's rubric.

8
00:00:41.149 --> 00:00:56.600
Ms. Al-Sayed · grade 4 teacher: Rubric scores become the official grade when she approves it, then she shares the feedback with Hana and her family.

9
00:00:56.600 --> 00:01:00.100
Try it yourself at educateos.io/demo. The real district application, running in your browser. No sign-in, nothing sent anywhere.
